Dermoscopic image shows a pink to erythematous background with a “strawberry pattern” of prominent whitish follicular openings and superficial white-yellow scales, fine linear or dotted vessels, occasional brownish pigmentation and variable keratotic crusts.
Actinic keratosis on dermoscopy shows pink to erythematous background with superficial white‑yellow scaling or keratin, irregular linear or dotted vessels, thin scaly patches to thicker hyperkeratotic plaques.
In dermoscopy, actinic keratosis appears as a pink to erythematous patch with superficial white-yellow scaling, clustered follicular plugs or rosettes, variable dotted or fine linear vessels, and occasional brown dots or faint pigmented pseudonetwork.
On dermoscopy actinic keratosis typically shows a pink to red background with superficial white-yellow scale, dilated follicular openings or keratotic plugs, fine dotted or linear vessels, rosettes.
Under dermoscopy, actinic keratosis appears as a pink to erythematous background with superficial whitish-yellow scales and keratotic follicular plugs, a coarse pseudo-network, scattered dotted or linear vessels, occasional white rosettes.
Actinic keratosis on dermoscopy often shows a pink to reddish background with superficial white-yellow scale, clustered dotted or glomerular vessels forming a pseudonetwork, sometimes rosettes or hyperkeratotic crusts.
On dermoscopy, actinic keratosis appears as pink to erythematous scaly patches with focal white-yellow keratin, visible dilated dotted or glomerular vessels, interrupted hair follicles with white dots.
In dermoscopy, actinic keratoses often show an erythematous background with patchy white-yellow scale, prominent follicular openings or a “strawberry” pseudo-network, dotted or linear vessels.
On dermoscopy, actinic keratoses appear as erythematous to pink macules or palpable papules with overlying white‑yellow scales, interrupted pseudo‑network or strawberry pattern, variable brown dots.
Dermoscopy shows a rough pink to erythematous macule or patch with superficial white-yellow scale, glomerular or dotted vascular patterns, scaly crusts, and variable pigmentation as faint brownish reticulation or speckled darker foci.
